Package: Friedman
Title: Weather Forecast
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Vinny", "Nguyen",
            email= "nguyenv5@usf.edu",
            role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package is an easy way to plot weather data onto plots using
    ggplot2 and dplyr. You just need to enter a location and it will pull
    weather data and plot it on barcharts, histograms, scatterplots, or piecharts.
Depends: specify R (>= 3.1.2) only.
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr
License: CC0
LazyData: true
